   - "IMPRESSION:###Grade 1 anterolisthesis of L5 over S1 with bilateral spondylolysis, pseudo bulge and annular tear causing secondary canal narrowing and exiting nerve root indentation.###Diffuse disc bulge with left paracentral extrusion at L5-S1 causing severe canal stenosis and left traversing nerve root compression."
